1
00:00:02,283 --> 00:00:04,283
(Leonard:)Did you hear about this study
that found people

2
00:00:04,285 --> 00:00:06,885
(Leonard:)that were cool and popular
at 13

3
00:00:06,888 --> 00:00:08,618
(Leonard:)have problems succeeding
later in life?

4
00:00:08,623 --> 00:00:11,053
(Raj:)Hmm. I'm doing okay,
and I was very popular at 13.

5
00:00:11,059 --> 00:00:12,189
(Penny:)In school?

6
00:00:12,193 --> 00:00:13,863
(Raj:)Oh, no. At home.

7
00:00:14,629 --> 00:00:15,829
(Raj:)The servants would sing to me,

8
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:17,730
(Raj:)laugh at my jokes...

9
00:00:18,533 --> 00:00:22,033
(Raj:)I wish I knew their names.

10
00:00:22,036 --> 00:00:25,006
(Penny:)Does the study say what happens
to the unpopular kids?

11
00:00:25,006 --> 00:00:27,476
(Leonard:)You tell me... you woke up
in bed with one.

12
00:00:28,609 --> 00:00:30,439
(Sheldon:)Listen to this.

13
00:00:30,445 --> 00:00:33,145
(Sheldon:)I just received an e-mail
from Wil Wheaton.

14
00:00:33,147 --> 00:00:36,147
(Sheldon:)Leonard Nimoy's son is
working on a documentary

15
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:38,420
(Sheldon:)that he started with his
father before he passed away.

16
00:00:38,419 --> 00:00:40,619
(Sheldon:)It's about Mr. Spock and
his impact on our culture.

17
00:00:40,621 --> 00:00:41,591
(Raj:)Hmm.

18
00:00:41,589 --> 00:00:42,819
(Leonard:)Why is he writing to you?

19
00:00:42,824 --> 00:00:44,824
(Sheldon:)Well, they're looking
for fans to interview,

20
00:00:44,826 --> 00:00:46,596
(Sheldon:)and Wil thought
I'd be good for it.

21
00:00:46,594 --> 00:00:47,664
(Raj:)Oh. Hey, high five.

22
00:00:47,662 --> 00:00:49,062
(Sheldon:)Absolutely not.

23
00:00:50,698 --> 00:00:51,668
(Sheldon:)Yeah, Penny,

24
00:00:51,666 --> 00:00:52,836
(Sheldon:)you spent some time
in front

25
00:00:52,834 --> 00:00:55,164
(Sheldon:)of the camera.
Any words of advice?

26
00:00:55,169 --> 00:00:56,469
(Penny:)Yes. Don't take your shirt off

27
00:00:56,471 --> 00:00:58,871
(Penny:)just because the director
said so.

28
00:00:58,873 --> 00:01:01,103
(Sheldon:)This is a documentary
about Mr. Spock.

29
00:01:01,109 --> 00:01:04,579
(Sheldon:)I'm sure if there's nudity,
it will be tasteful.

30
00:01:05,646 --> 00:01:09,286
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

